Path | Behaviour / field | ORDER BY field ASC / -field | ORDER BY field DESC / relation.field | LEFT JOIN relation → ORDER BY relation.field ASC / -relation.field | LEFT JOIN relation → ORDER BY relation.field DESC / a.b.field | LEFT JOIN a → LEFT JOIN b → ORDER BY b.field ASC
Only M2O hops are supported in sort paths. O2M and M2M are intentionally excluded — a row has many related values so there is no single value to sort by.

