**Option B — Tailwind v3 preset.** If your app already runs Tailwind 3 and you want one utility pipeline (no duplicated classes):
// tailwind.config.js
module.exports = {
  presets: [require('@nivaro/react/tailwind-preset')],
  content: [
    './src/**/*.{ts,tsx}',
    './node_modules/@nivaro/react/dist/**/*.js'
  ]
